rem Ruff Numbers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=773

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Count integer = 97
arg Mod integer = 1000000007

rem n = 7 mod 10 is prime to 2 and 5.
rem By inclusion-exclusion over subsets
rem D of the k primes, with m the
rem product over D and P the product of
rem all, the n < 10 P with n = 7 mod 10
rem and m | n are n = m (s + 10 u),
rem s = 7 / m mod 10, u < P / m. The sum
rem over D with signs gives
rem F = P sum_j (-1)^j C(k, j) s(j)
rem + 5 P prod (p - 1), since
rem m = 7^|D| mod 10 fixes s by |D|.
fun Left mulp Right
  return Left * Right mod Mod
end
Odds = primes to 100000 copy
Ends = Odds filter (Odds mod 10 equal 7)
Used = Ends take Count
Total = Used scan mulp
Prod = Total (Count - 1)
Down = (Used - 1) scan mulp
Phi = Down (Count - 1)
Index = 0 to Count
Fact = (Index max 1) scan mulp
Inv = Fact (Mod - 2) Mod powmod
Top = Fact Count
Mirror = Inv reverse
Half = Top * Inv mod Mod
Ways = Half * Mirror mod Mod
Seeds = array 7 1 3 9
Digit = Seeds (Index mod 4)
Sign = 1 - 2 * (Index mod 2)
Terms = Ways * Digit * Sign mod Mod
Mixed = (Terms sum) mod Mod
Extra = 5 * Phi mod Mod
Both = (Mixed + Extra) mod Mod
return Prod * Both mod Mod
